WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Bu qismda tenglamaga boshqacha qaraymiz: M d x plyus N d y teng nol.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.008
Agar chap tomon biror U funksiyaning to‘la differensiali bo‘lsa, javob shunchaki U teng C.

3
00:00:13.008 --> 00:00:20.160
Biz buni qanday tekshirishni, U ni qanday tiklashni va tenglama to‘la differensialli bo‘lmasa,

4
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.734
uni qanday ko‘paytuvchi bilan tuzatishni o‘rganamiz.

5
00:00:24.984 --> 00:00:30.624
Agar U ning x bo‘yicha hosilasi M, y bo‘yicha hosilasi N bo‘lsa,

6
00:00:30.624 --> 00:00:38.016
aralash hosilalar teng bo‘lgani uchun M ning y bo‘yicha hosilasi N ning x bo‘yicha hosilasiga teng.

7
00:00:38.016 --> 00:00:41.904
Bir bog‘lamli sohada bu shart yetarli ham.

8
00:00:41.904 --> 00:00:48.446
Demak birinchi qadam doim bitta: M y va N x ni hisoblab, solishtirish.

9
00:00:48.696 --> 00:00:57.696
Misol: ikki x y plyus uch x kvadrat, d x, plyus x kvadrat plyus ikki y, d y, teng nol.

10
00:00:57.696 --> 00:01:04.200
M ning y bo‘yicha hosilasi ikki x, N ning x bo‘yicha hosilasi ham ikki x.

11
00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.432
Shart bajarildi.

12
00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:13.368
M ni x bo‘yicha integrallaymiz: x kvadrat y plyus x kub plyus h dan y.

13
00:01:13.368 --> 00:01:17.270
h — y ning noma’lum funksiyasi.

14
00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:27.960
h ni topish uchun U ni y bo‘yicha differensiallaymiz va N ga tenglaymiz: x kvadrat plyus h shtrix teng x kvadrat plyus ikki y.

15
00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:32.712
Demak h shtrix ikki y, h esa y kvadrat.

16
00:01:32.712 --> 00:01:38.520
Javob: x kvadrat y plyus x kub plyus y kvadrat teng C.

17
00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:43.022
Agar h shtrixda x qolsa, hisobda xato bor.

18
00:01:43.272 --> 00:01:45.768
Shart bajarilmasa-chi?

19
00:01:45.768 --> 00:01:53.112
Masalan, x kvadrat plyus y kvadrat plyus x, d x, plyus x y, d y.

20
00:01:53.112 --> 00:01:56.904
M y ikki y, N x esa y.

21
00:01:56.904 --> 00:02:03.624
M y minus N x ni N ga bo‘lsak, bir bo‘lingan x chiqadi — faqat x ga bog‘liq.

22
00:02:03.624 --> 00:02:08.016
Demak mu teng e daraja logarifm x, ya’ni x.

23
00:02:08.016 --> 00:02:13.310
Ko‘paytirgandan keyin tenglama to‘la differensialli bo‘ladi.

24
00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:20.040
Grafikda birinchi misolning yo‘nalish maydoni va bir nechta integral chiziq ko‘rsatilgan.

25
00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:25.080
Har bir chiziq U funksiyaning sath chizig‘i: unda U o‘zgarmas.

26
00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:31.814
To‘la differensialli tenglamani yechish — U ning sath chiziqlarini topish demakdir.

27
00:02:32.064 --> 00:02:39.072
Tekshiruv savoli: ekrandagi nisbat berilgan bo‘lsa, integrallovchi ko‘paytuvchi nimaga teng?

28
00:02:39.072 --> 00:02:42.590
Eksponentani olishni unutmang.
